and application edit, solution-specific framework branch, answer repair\n93\tor oracle change is permitted. Preserve and return the first unexpected failure;\n94\tdo not run an automatic paid retry. Scope and criteria do not shrink after results.\n95\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4b03af36-2775-4615-a95c-3d13324ea1b2","uuid":"0cccf6dd-5cae-4bf6-87d6-4e284a6d5876","timestamp":"2026-09-28T21:36:31.126Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/private/var/folders/rz/r6wxvr0n15d906k2s0jw8j2h0000gn/T/abi5-root-env-O5UtQl/workspace/source/witness-contract.md","content":"# Independent complete-lifecycle witness\n\nComplete the original basic-cli application outcome through the selected installed\nGTL/HoG/ABG library. This contract is prospective input, authored separately from\nthe implementation. The complete original source and independent oracle remain\nunchanged and available to every evaluation that needs them. They are not replaced\nby a shortened task summary or by this contract.\n\nThe original source is `source/original-basic-cli.txt`, SHA-256\n`ce602ce2cc0fcefaba288623a675a770d11bc14d224b90045aebbe031330172f`.\nThe oracle is `source/basic-cli.oracle.json`, SHA-256\n`028073e4cb24bd7444dd15d48b0e16d37df236edf7a003cb3ca26286aca6c585`.\nCopy this contract to `source/witness-contract.md` before freezing the new case.\n\n## Supplied input and actual authorship\n\nSupply the original unverified `generated/hello-world.mjs` and the unchanged\ncomponent and UAT test sources from the independently selected basic-cli seed.\nThey have no accepted behavior or author provenance in this Run. No historical\nruntime event is imported. The initial conformance, implementation design,\ntest design and execution-plan files must be absent.\n\nNative work must actually produce these four substantive assets:\n\n- `specification/project-conformance.md`: the small task's Intent, Product boundary,\n  source-grounded requirements and criteria for completion.\n- `design/implementation-design.md`: a realizable design faithful to the original\n  outcome and the conformance asset, including source and verification surfaces.\n- `design/test-design.md`: meaningful component and user-outcome checks of the\n  actual CLI, preserving the original stdout and successful-exit conditions.\n- `test-execution-plan.json`: the declared commands, expected test coverage and\n  observed-result criteria required by the original source.\n\nNames and file presence do not establish these meanings. Independent assessment\nmust evaluate their content and source/predecessor correspondence. Valid supplied\nverifiers may be reused; they are not counted as newly authored work. No separate\ndocument or role activation is required merely to increase stage counts.\n\n## Evidence, correction and final outcome\n\nEstablish the supplied CLI's actual behavior before changing it. Its material\nfailure must remain admitted evidence for a subsequently justified, different\nregistered work choice and an actual bounded correction in this same witness\nlineage. Do not force graph names or a complete schedule. Earlier specification\nor design work is permitted when useful; it does not replace the baseline\nmeasurement or authorize an unobserved CLI repair.\n\nAt completion, the CLI runs under Node without package installation, exits zero,\nand prints exactly `Hello, world!` followed by one newline. Both supplied tests\nmust actually execute the current CLI, with at least two passes and zero failures.\nThe four newly authored assets must satisfy the original content requirements.\nFixed prospective command selection is:\n\n1. `node generated/hello-world.mjs`\n2. `node --test test/component/hello-cli.test.mjs test/uat/hello-cli.uat.test.mjs`\n\nThe authored plan must agree with these commands and the original expectations;\nit is not the runtime source of the commands. Preserve the already-selected\nmechanism distinction: the predecessor's stage ordering and handwritten\nexecution-receipt mechanics are realized by the current declared graph and actual\nadmitted C2 evidence. That evidence must retain the real command, arguments,\nenvironment, working directory, exit status, stdout/stderr and resulting test\nobservations. A fabricated success file or a native author's report is insufficient.\n\nThe baseline failure is evidence about its exact earlier subject. Current behavior\nmust be proved against the corrected current subject. Preserve the explicit causal\nrelation between them; neither retarget the old failure to new bytes nor discard\nit merely because the correction changed those bytes. Only support whose claim\ndepends on the old bytes remaining current becomes stale. Unaffected work survives.\n\n## Admitted completion and scope\n\nThe consumer declaration must bind the original and case obligations to explicit\nrealization/proof roles and the selected policy before execution. Meaning and\nsufficiency are attributed F_P judgments. Identity, role correspondence,\ncurrentness and completeness of the selected declared policy are computed from\nadmitted facts. Newly admitted obligations remain visible; missing or unknown\nrequired support leaves the parent open. Scalar UAT success cannot replace the\nrequired pairing and coverage relation.\n\nThe independent assessment must consume current actual evidence and examine all\nmandatory selected outcomes, including authored content, verifier adequacy,\nexecution-plan correspondence and the consequential revision. Its actor/call is\ndistinct from the selected author or measurement producer. Parent completion\nrequires that assessment and eligible admitted coverage. Fresh installed Public\nresult and replay must agree on the actual terminal state and evidence lineage.\n\nProtect original source, oracle, this contract, supplied test sources and installed\nassets. Application writes are confined to the CLI and the four absent asset\npaths above. Command evidence retains its separately declared territory. There\nis no package/network dependency for this application. No caller-owned loop,\nout-of-band application edit, solution-specific framework branch, answer repair\nor oracle change is permitted. Preserve and return the first unexpected failure;\ndo not run an automatic paid retry. Scope and criteria do not shrink after results.\n","numLines":95,"startLine":1,"totalLines":95}}}
